## ⚙️ Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| ⚡ Wireless Charging | Inductive coupling WPT — no physical connectors needed |
| ☀️ Solar Powered | PV panels contribute 65–70% energy per charging session |
| 🔐 RFID Auth | Secure tag-based access with automated billing |
| 📡 IoT Monitoring | Real-time sensor data streamed to cloud via ESP32 Wi-Fi |
| 🖥️ Web Dashboard | Live slot status, payments, sensor history, admin controls |
| 🔋 Battery Backup | Uninterrupted operation during low solar or grid outage |
| ☁️ Cloud Integration | MySQL + PHP cloud database for session logs and analytics |
| 🔔 Alerts | OLED display + buzzer for charging status and fault alerts |

