## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Hardware
| Component | Role |
|---|---|
| ESP32 Microcontroller | Central IoT controller — Wi-Fi, sensors, relay, RFID |
| WPT Kit (Inductive) | Wireless power transfer to EV receiver coil |
| RFID Reader (RC522) + Tags | Secure user authentication |
| Solar PV Panel | Primary renewable energy source |
| 12V Lithium Battery | Energy storage and backup |
| Voltage & Current Sensors | Real-time charging monitoring |
| Relay Module | Circuit switching based on auth and sensor state |
| OLED Display | On-device status display |
| Buzzer | Audible alerts for events and faults |
| Voltage Regulators | Stable supply to all electronic components |

### Software
| Tool / Platform | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Arduino IDE + Embedded C/C++ | ESP32 firmware development |
| PHP | Web-based dashboard backend |
| MySQL | Cloud database for sessions, billing, and logs |
| HTML / CSS / JS | Frontend dashboard UI |
| IoT Cloud (iotcloud22.in) | Real-time data hosting and monitoring |

